==History==
2017
*The Flying Machine was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Flying Machine Draft Challenge]], which started on 22/9/2017. In this challenge, gameplay was similar to a regular Draft Challenge, except that one of the players was able to choose who would use the Flying Machine. If the player achieved at least 8 wins, they obtained the Flying Machine early.
*From 29/9/2017 through 1/10/2017, the [[Shop]] had a special offer where [[Arenas|Arena]] 9+ players could buy up to 6 Giant [[Chests]] at the normal price that guarantee at least 40% of the Chest's contents to be Flying Machine.
*The Flying Machine [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 6/10/2017.
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic Quests Update (9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], changed the Flying Machine's card image.
2018
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Flying Machine from Jungle Arena to Builder's Workshop.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
2019
*On 1/4/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/4/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Flying Machine's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1 second).
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Flying Machine's card info screen.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], added the Efficient Attacker [[Card Mastery]] task for the Flying Machine.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).

